\par
(Ij ; j{$\frac{1}{4}$} 1; 2; 3) that represent three agents (Aj ; j{$\frac{1}{4}$} 1; 2; 3), respectively (Agent
\par
A1: Nation 1; Agent A2: Nation 2; and Agent A3: Nation 3). Each local influence
\par
