\par
The information, called requisite information, is encoded in a subset of
\par
either required observation nodes or requisite probability nodes for
\par
decision dk in influence diagram Ij . Hence, in a control relevance graph,
\par
it is said that agent Ai controls agent Aj 's decision dk with the information
\par
