3. Results
\par
3.1. General patterns of the posterior parameter distributions
\par
The MCMC sequences of the models converged rapidly ({$\approx$}5000
\par
iterations) and the statistics reported herein were based on the last
\par
45,000 draws by keeping every 10th iteration (thin = 10). The eval-
\par
uation of the degree of updating of model input parameters was
\par
based on the shifts of the most possible values and the reduction of
\par
the parameter uncertainty. The relative differences between global
\par
