3.3. Game Order
\par
In CDW resource utilization supply chains, the remanufacturer is the leader of the
\par
Stackelberg game and the recycler is the follower. The game order (as shown in Figure 2)
\par
is: first, the recycler decides whether to share their demand forecast information with the
\par
remanufacturer; secondly, the remanufacturer decides their own environmental responsi-
\par
bility level according to whether the recycler shares their demand forecast information and
\par
the degree of the optimism or pessimism of that demand forecast information; thirdly, the
\par
remanufacturer predicts the recycler's pricing situation and then determines the online and
\par
